 is a seafood restaurant in Roma Norte, Mexico City, Mexico, near Fuente de Cibeles. It is owned by the restaurateur Gabriela Cámara, who opened it in 1998 on Durango Avenue. Her aim was to recreate the experience of dining at a beachside palapa."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-contramar"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contramar"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Mexican cuisine","cuisine/mexican-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Mexico in My Kitchen","ref":"site/mexicoinmykitchen-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"mexicoinmykitchen.com","note":"Mely Martínez's long-running blog of Mexican home-style recipes.","url":"https://www.mexicoinmykitchen.com/","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"},{"name":"Pati Jinich","ref":"site/patijinich-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"patijinich.com","note":"Recipe archive from the Mexican-born chef and host of the PBS series Pati's Mexican Table.","url":"https://patijinich.com/recipes/","suggested":true,"kind":"site"}]},{"h":"More from Mexican cuisine","links":[["Acapulco Mexican Restaurant and Cantina","dish/acapulco-mexican-restaurant-and-cantina"],["Amigos (restaurant chain)","dish/amigos-restaurant-chain"],["Animalón","dish/animalon"],["Anna's Taqueria","dish/anna-s-taqueria"],["Baker's Drive-Thru","dish/baker-s-drive-thru"],["Barburrito","dish/barburrito"],["Birrieria La Plaza","dish/birrieria-la-plaza"],["Birrieria PDX","dish/birrieria-pdx"],["Boca Grande Taqueria","dish/boca-grande-taqueria"],["BurritoVille","dish/burritoville"],["Cafe Rio","dish/cafe-rio"],["California Tortilla","dish/california-tortilla"],["Cantina Mariachi","dish/cantina-mariachi"],["Carlos'n Charlie's","dish/carlos-n-charlie-s"],["Casa Bonita","dish/casa-bonita"],["Casa Enrique","dish/casa-enrique"],["Casa Vega","dish/casa-vega"],["Chevys Fresh Mex","dish/chevys-fresh-mex"],["Chi-Chi's","dish/chi-chi-s"],["Chico's Tacos","dish/chico-s-tacos"],["Chile con queso","dish